OL,3,GNEWSARapist coerced and threatened
OL,4,Awomen with knives
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for raping two
OL,7,Fwomen as well as controlling and
OL,8,Fcoercive behaviour towards them.
OL,10,FJacob Evans was sentenced to 15 years
OL,11,Fin prison at Chester Crown Court, with
OL,12,Fa further six years on licence.
OL,14,FEvans, from Baddington, near Nantwich,
OL,15,FCheshire, previously pleaded guilty to
OL,16,Ffour counts of rape and sexual assault
OL,17,Fby penetration.
