OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 22-year-old also pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Ftwo counts of actual bodily harm, two
OL,8,Fcounts of making threats with a bladed
OL,9,Fweapon and two counts of engaging in
OL,10,Fcontrolling and coercive behaviour.
OL,11,FCheshire Police commended the "courage"
OL,12,Fof his victims.
